ovember 2019</div><div class=\"ftime\">1:00 pm</div></time></div><table class=\"fevent\"><tbody><tr itemprop=\"name\">\n<th class=\"fhome\" itemprop=\"homeTeam\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http&#58;//schema.org/SportsTeam\"><span itemprop=\"name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a></span></th><th class=\"fscore\">1–0</th><th class=\"faway\" itemprop=\"awayTeam\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http&#58;//schema.org/SportsTeam\"><span itemprop=\"name\"><a href=\"/wiki/Landskrona_BoIS\" title=\"Landskrona BoIS\">Landskrona BoIS</a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"fgoals\">\n<td class=\"fhgoal\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Keene_(footballer)\" title=\"James Keene (footballer)\">Keene</a> <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Goal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></span></span>&#32;<span>74'</span></span></td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/matchfakta/osters-if-landskrona-bois-kval/4402494/\">Report</a></td>\n<td class=\"fagoal\"></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div class=\"fright\"><div itemprop=\"location\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http&#58;//schema.org/Place\"><span itemprop=\"name address\"><a href=\"/wiki/Myresj%C3%B6hus_Arena\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myresjöhus Arena\">Myresjöhus Arena</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6\" title=\"Växjö\">Växjö</a></span></div><div>Attendance: 3,719</div><div>Referee: Adam Ladebäck</div></div></div>\n<p><i>Östers IF won 2–1 on aggregate and qualified for the <a href=\"/wiki/2020_Superettan\" title=\"2020 Superettan\">2020 Superettan</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r997937747\" /><div itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http&#58;//schema.org/SportsEvent\" class=\"footballbox\" style=\"color:inherit\">\n<div class=\"fleft\"><time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2019-11-07T19:00:00+00:00\"><div class=\"fdate\">7 November 2019</div><div class=\"ftime\">7:00 pm</div></time></div><table class=\"fevent\"><tbody><tr itemprop=\"name\">\n<th class=\"fhome\" itemprop=\"homeTeam\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http&#58;//schema.org/SportsTeam\"><span itemprop=\"name\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_FC\" title=\"Umeå FC\">Umeå FC</a></span></th><th class=\"fscore\">1–1</th><th class=\"faway\" itemprop=\"awayTeam\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http&#58;//schema.org/SportsTeam\"><span itemprop=\"name\"><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Frej\" title=\"IK Frej\">IK Frej</a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"fgoals\">\n<td class=\"fhgoal\">Stigedahl <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Goal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></span></span>&#32;<span>68'</span></span></td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/matchfakta/umea-fc-ik-frej-taby-kval/4402493/\">Report</a></td>\n<td class=\"fagoal\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdul_Halik_Hudu\" title=\"Abdul Halik Hudu\">Hudu</a> <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Goal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//uplo